@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
actor User
rectangle "AI Second Brain" {
  component "CTO Agent" as CTO
  component "Agent Workforce" as Workforce
  component "Job Manager" as Jobs
  component "Approval Gateway" as Approval
  component "API Tool Registry" as Tools
  component "Virtual Environment" as Env
  database "Memory / Artifacts" as Store
}
User --> CTO : chat / command
CTO --> Workforce : delegate
Workforce --> Jobs : create / assign jobs
Jobs --> Env : execute isolated work
Workforce --> Tools : request tool
Tools --> Approval : check policy
Approval --> Tools : allow / deny
Tools --> Env : execute API action
Jobs --> Store : logs / artifacts
Workforce --> Store : memory / results
@enduml
